  base-contracts      https://github.com/cofferdamxyz/base-contracts

Third-party data

The Work plane's token registry is loaded with data this repository does
not contain:

- The US layer includes information from the O*NET 31.0 Database by the
  U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration
  (USDOL/ETA). Used under the CC BY 4.0 license
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Cofferdam Inc. has
  modified all or some of this information: job titles were split into
  their long and short forms, bare acronyms were left out, and each title
  was placed on an ESCO occupation through the ESCO-O*NET crosswalk
  (version 1, September 2022, published by the ESCO Secretariat with
  USDOL/ETA); test/onet.import.test.ts writes the list of every change.
  USDOL/ETA has not approved, endorsed, or tested these modifications.
  O*NET(R) is a trademark of USDOL/ETA.
